ENTITY {NAME}
COMPONENT Transform {XPOS} {YPOS} 0 12 10
COMPONENT Material PlayerMat
COMPONENT Renderer 2 1
COMPONENT Sprite CharacterAtlas BlackWalk_Down00
COMPONENT Animation 
COMPONENT Drag 
COMPONENT State Idle
COMPONENT Script NPC1Script

ADDANIMATION Walk Up BlackWalk_up
ADDANIMATION Walk Down BlackWalk_down
ADDANIMATION Walk Right BlackWalk_right
ADDANIMATION Walk Left BlackWalk_left
ADDANIMATION Walk UpLeft BlackWalk_upleft
ADDANIMATION Walk DownLeft BlackWalk_downleft
ADDANIMATION Walk UpRight BlackWalk_upright
ADDANIMATION Walk DownRight BlackWalk_downright
STATEPRIORITY Walk 1 0 Ignore


ADDANIMATION Idle Up BlackIdle_up
ADDANIMATION Idle Down BlackIdle_down
ADDANIMATION Idle Right BlackIdle_right
ADDANIMATION Idle Left BlackIdle_left
ADDANIMATION Idle UpLeft BlackIdle_upleft
ADDANIMATION Idle DownLeft BlackIdle_downleft
ADDANIMATION Idle UpRight BlackIdle_upright
ADDANIMATION Idle DownRight BlackIdle_downright
STATEPRIORITY Idle 0 0 Ignore

ADDANIMATION Hold None BlackHold_down
STATEPRIORITY Hold 3 0 Ignore
ENTITYINIT {NAME}